{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fa394a29fc80e66443c59833b863885fe3363f290d22168e42b0e9969c4a30ea", "ja": "（ついに琴葉が初めて劇場のステージに立つ日。\nもうすぐ出番だが、琴葉の様子は……）", "zh": "（终于到了琴叶第一次站上剧场舞台的日子。\n就快轮到她出场了，看看琴叶的状况……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "e86c2ebec1bafe05a2b7c7a094f48ec292eedc02c127c9b9274da287875683d1", "ja": "あ、{$P$}、よかったです。\n念のため、確認しておきたいことがあって。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，太好了。\n保险起见，我有事想跟你确认。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "bdf4b3b4d00c70a84920096da5cd72acd54e5033a044a70497d656dd9a45aebc", "ja": "ああ、かまわないけど……本番直前だっていうのに、\nずいぶん落ち着いてるんだな。", "zh": "嗯，是可以啦……虽说就快正式上台了，\n你却挺冷静的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "a4871fd377662d4ce269a69c7dd7ee786698b3ffaa277a4ac56276c5beb8b65c", "ja": "ふふ、ありがとうございます。\nこれでも一応、演劇部ですから。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢你。\n别看我这样，毕竟也参加过话剧社。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "61e6c2b49ca369ec55492f778103e0f6f77fee27da2558e06cae12e0eb0b69e2", "ja": "ここまで来たら、もう覚悟を決めるしかない……\nということは、知ってるつもりです。", "zh": "既然来到这一步，就只能下定决心了……\n这点我想自己还算明白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b851ad5dd58587df294be64f73237d7c6f3b2fdbdc3411b50c2f1f3de675fd1a", "ja": "なるほど、頼もしいな。\nそれで確認したいことって？", "zh": "原来如此，真可靠呢。\n那你说想确认的事是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "8360a4f5e93b92a5ef2bad48d8d3c46ae3fd72ca7a57868d38e06ddb0ba7299e", "ja": "はい。舞台に向かう心得はともかくとして……\nアイドルとしての心得を、聞いておきたくて。", "zh": "就是啊，先不说登上舞台时的注意事项……\n我想请教当偶像的注意事项。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ea5d7ec2c2b207643aa57be2ecf728bfa82709c0bef564caaf04d5c14f8ef263", "ja": "アイドルとしての心得……？", "zh": "当偶像的注意事项……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "fcfeca28041087891738b1b36b93473ce2300de96211c7e1ebe089c6716bd4c9", "ja": "ダンスは演技、歌は台本と思えば、\n舞台に上がることは怖くありません。ただ……", "zh": "如果把舞蹈想成演技，把歌唱想成剧本，\n我并不怕登上舞台。只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "4a3652f866eaa63b7a90db78c6d0882837bcaf3833033a13d494a2634439cf92", "ja": "もしアイドルにはアイドルの心得があるなら、\nそれは聞いておかないと、と思って。", "zh": "但要是当偶像也有偶像的注意事项，\n就得先问清楚才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3d506307eff6e50a53b95353e732866ec1dbcc7716f277ca2509de91cded45e6", "ja": "（なるほど。演劇の舞台とは違う、\nアイドルの舞台に臨む上での心得か……）", "zh": "（原来如此。不同於戏剧舞台，\n而是登上偶像舞台时的注意事项……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_1011_p", "source_sha256": "37236556310658811f8f1a816ce3b3d1b518b1946e5659ed67eb74dd9b2a9b36", "ja": "よし。それじゃ、その琴葉の強みでもある\n演劇の舞台に上がった経験。それを……。", "zh": "好。那么，这份同时也是琴叶强项、\n曾登上戏剧舞台的经验，你把它……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_1012", "source_sha256": "8a76c08371a904e44b5409e9ef3161465ef413991388894853562c589fe4e161", "ja": "忘れよう", "zh": "忘掉吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_2000_p", "source_sha256": "b8b91a0d58e19f15ddbe00d89aa6eb09d65354941ea954c411f6e1c8646b3844", "ja": "1回、忘れよう。きれいさっぱり。", "zh": "姑且先忘掉吧，忘得一干二净。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_2001_017kth", "source_sha256": "08fa7e7bd6b86e470576d09cd84d4cc296c53a1a4d532c46e01830cca9fa1e7c", "ja": "えっ？　忘れるって……、ええっ！？\nど、どうしてそんなことを？", "zh": "咦？你说忘掉……咦咦！？\n为、为什么要这样做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_2002_p", "source_sha256": "9a7cc3deaf73d16367e01ec3bee969abbc6fd0126b714cefb3f4804678555fa6", "ja": "たしかに、舞台に上ったアイドルが披露するのは、\nダンスという演技、歌という台詞だ。", "zh": "确实，登上舞台的偶像所展现的，\n是名为舞蹈的演技、名为歌唱的台词。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_2003_p", "source_sha256": "1bc9a72ef513f77392bf7e0acf4b93390407c9f61e4d64bd715ed0f16af6e30d", "ja": "でも、アイドルがファンに届けなきゃいけない\n一番大事なものは、そういう技術じゃないと思う。", "zh": "然而，偶像要带给粉丝的重点，\n不在于那些技术。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_2004_017kth", "source_sha256": "8771ce49bd923974665841705c6054dd6bf8b7d8427616e3ccd72ed7e6b918fc", "ja": "アイドルがファンに届けなきゃいけない、\n一番大事なもの……ですか？", "zh": "偶像要带给粉丝的重点\n……是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_2005", "source_sha256": "6e997c1ce7d59defb50b1c6ff68e7732e6ed3ac47b9c4655429c86f707315a61", "ja": "田中琴葉", "zh": "田中琴叶", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_3000_p", "source_sha256": "8aeedda948b5064dadc92422b3504a6cad8d93deb9d9ed694870594e2b809e71", "ja": "田中琴葉、じゃないかな。ファンのみんなは、\n琴葉が演じる誰かじゃなく……。", "zh": "答案就是田中琴叶本身吧。\n粉丝们并不是来见琴叶饰演的某人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_3001_p", "source_sha256": "bd00c8415cb531a8b7b948df48511a3a1af8c53364e07a755226071ba26a37fd", "ja": "琴葉。君に会いに来てくれたんだから。", "zh": "琴叶，大家是来见你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_3002_017kth", "source_sha256": "eae079fb98ba5cf091dacfd3440f92d23aefe105018b2b543e58085c5a89b6a8", "ja": "私、に…………。", "zh": "来见我…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_3003_017kth", "source_sha256": "3a6a518d8f15f7a808c46b4b635d42137f3df0adfe901070c77e1ed3dc465e35", "ja": "そう……でした。今日は、私が……\n田中琴葉が舞台に立つ姿を、見せないとでしたね……。", "zh": "是这样……没错。我今天……\n应该展现出田中琴叶站在舞台上的模样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_3004_017kth", "source_sha256": "3546955c798cf3b5dff945b5b13e47d13a06e113f0aee4ae19a4579b497fff90", "ja": "演じている役柄……他の誰かでは、決してなく。\n新人アイドルの、田中琴葉として……。", "zh": "不是我饰演的角色……不是其他人，\n而是以新人偶像田中琴叶的身分……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_3005_p", "source_sha256": "df83011e244f1295c1039ece68eb2193b030385f700e106b1b77360bdf15a9bb", "ja": "（ステージパフォーマンスも、当然大事だ。\nでもそれは、アイドルにとって手段のひとつ……）", "zh": "（舞台表演当然也很重要，\n但那对偶像来说只是其中一种手段……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_3006_017kth", "source_sha256": "eb7e90257893062614bb5aec1ceecc89f84f924b8c68147654dd9c78365d63b9", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとうございます。\nアイドルとして、大事なことが、わかった気がします。", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你。\n我似乎明白了当偶像的重要道理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_3007_017kth", "source_sha256": "e7279b6e0eb6c54c76557ba20dcdc6615e0cd6a54b6b89562a46d7bcabec7ea1", "ja": "今の言葉は、私の中にしっかりとしまっておきます。\nこの先もずっと、忘れないように……。", "zh": "刚才那番话，我会好好放在心里，\n今后也会努力牢牢记住的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_3008_p", "source_sha256": "ff1002441f8c234d6354f1be67ce8dca44f61c4fcd867f147485d7c8bfb53730", "ja": "（そう言って顔を上げ、微笑む琴葉。\nその視線はきっと、遥かな未来に向けられて……）", "zh": "（琴叶这样说着，抬起脸并露出了微笑。\n想必此时她的眼中正望向遥远的未来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_3009_017kth", "source_sha256": "1fe5de31131bdda0b8db2e23c94a037621d7a3ca7d4f4c426ee5e2f4f89c6c18", "ja": "あ、ノートにも書いておかなくちゃ。\nえっと、どこに置いたかな……？", "zh": "啊，我也得写在笔记本上才行。\n我看看，收到哪里去了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_003_3010_p", "source_sha256": "8f0fe609064d868e713feb6820cc0dcd48ee5495365c83c735c4dfd471fd8444", "ja": "（それは……後でもいいんじゃないか？）", "zh": "（那个……之后再写也可以吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
